# Production / Vercel Environment Configuration
# Note: Guitarist is a client-side Web Audio application.
# All core features (fretboard, synthesizer, metronome, tuner) run in-browser with zero secrets.

# Optional: Set this if integrating custom serverless AI endpoints in the future
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Optional: Canonical application URL for self-referential links or custom domain
# VITE_APP_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app
